== Types of Cooldown ==
There are several different types of '''Cooldowns''', and each type primarily works in the same way but may or may not be affected by ability haste.

=== Normal Cooldowns ===
''Normal Cooldowns'' are the most basic form of cooldowns. Abilities or Items that have normal cooldowns get reduced by the respective haste. The cooldown associated with runes is considered a normal cooldown, but there are currently no sources of haste that affects runes.

=== Static Cooldowns ===
''Static Cooldowns'' are cooldowns that can not be reduced by any means of ability haste, unless it has a way to reduce itself or by an associated effect.

