Some champions have abilities that decrease their cooldowns by a flat amount, or by a percentage, affecting either their '''base''' cooldown or '''current''' cooldown. Some abilities can also completely refresh their cooldown. '''Base''' reduction occurs before ability haste takes effect while flat reduction occurs after ability haste takes effect.

Depending on the reduction type:
* Base (applies before AH)
* Flat (applies after AH)
* Percent (applies to '''base''' / '''current''' / '''total''' cooldown)
* Refresh (cooldown is immediately reduced to 0)

